---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const faq = [
	{
		question: 'Do you supply the fire pump itself?',
		answer: 'No. Wanlian supplies the adapter, valves and related connection equipment around the fire pump set by others. The pump supplier provides the pump selection and certified curve; we use those project inputs to coordinate the surrounding components.'
	},
	{
		question: 'What is a Siamese fire pump adapter?',
		answer: 'The SQD100-1.6 Fire Pump Adapter is a fire department Siamese connection with two DN65 inlets and one DN100 flanged outlet, plus an integrated control valve, for fire-engine water supply into the fire protection network.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Which valve belongs on the pump suction side?',
		answer: 'The suction arrangement is set by the approved pump-room design and the authority having jurisdiction. Isolation is normally kept fully open during pump operation; confirm the selected valve type, size and connection with the pump supplier and designer.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Where does the discharge check valve go?',
		answer: 'The discharge check valve is coordinated between the fire pump set by others and the discharge isolation valve to limit backflow. The final location, size and pressure class follow the approved piping layout and pump supplier data.'
	},
	{
		question: 'Can a pressure-reducing valve replace pump controls?',
		answer: 'No. The 500X is a hydraulic pressure-reducing valve for managing downstream pressure in a water line; it is not a substitute for the fire pump controller, pump relief arrangement or the pump supplier’s certified system design.'
	},
	{
		question: 'What information should I send for a pump-room package quote?',
		answer: 'Send the pump supplier’s flow and head data, suction and discharge pipe sizes, connection standards, test arrangement, fire department inlet standard, required certifications and the valve schedule or drawings.'
	}
];

const products = [
	{
		slug: 'sqd100-1-6-fire-pump-adapter',
		name: 'SQD100-1.6 Fire Pump Adapter (Siamese Connection)',
		img: '/assets/products/sqd100-1-6-fire-pump-adapter.webp',
		desc: '2 × DN65 inlets, DN100 flanged outlet, 1.6 MPa'
	},
	{
		slug: 'ul-fm-resilient-seat-osy-gate-valve',
		name: 'UL/FM Fire Protection Resilient Seated OS&Y Gate Valve',
		img: '/assets/products/ul-fm-resilient-seat-osy-gate-valve.webp',
		desc: '2"–10", grooved ends, rising stem, UL / FM listed'
	},
	{
		slug: 'resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x',
		name: 'Ductile Iron Resilient Seat Flanged Gate Valve (Z41X)',
		img: '/assets/products/resilient-seat-flanged-gate-valve-z41x.webp',
		desc: 'DN50–DN700, PN10 / PN16, ductile iron, flanged'
	},
	{
		slug: 'spherical-ball-check-valve-hq44x',
		name: 'Spherical Cast Iron Ball Check Valve (HQ44X-16)',
		img: '/assets/products/spherical-ball-check-valve-hq44x.webp',
		desc: 'DN50–DN400, PN16, non-blocking EPDM ball'
	},
	{
		slug: 'adjustable-pressure-reducing-valve-500x',
		name: 'Hydraulic Adjustable Pressure Reducing Valve (500X)',
		img: '/assets/products/pressure-reducing-valve-500x-dn50.webp',
		desc: 'DN20–DN600, 0.1–1.6 MPa adjustment, hydraulic pilot'
	}
];
---

<Layout
	title="Fire Pump Adapter, Siamese Connection & Pump Room Valves | WLFE"
	description="Fire pump adapter, Siamese connection and pump room valves for suction, discharge and test arrangements around a fire pump set by others."
	type="product"
	productData={{
		name: 'Fire Pump Connections and Pump Room Valves',
		image: '/assets/products/sqd100-1-6-fire-pump-adapter.webp',
		description: 'Fire department connections, pump adapters, gate valves, check valves and pressure control components for coordinated fire pump room packages.'
	}}
	faq={faq}
	breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Fire Pump Connections' }]}
>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 mb-16">
		<nav class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 flex gap-2">
			<a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<a href="/products/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Products</a>
			<span>/</span>
			<span class="text-gray-600">Fire Pump Connections</span>
		</nav>

		<article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10">
			<p class="text-brand-red font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">Pump Room Valves and Fire Department Connections</p>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">Fire Pump Adapter and Pump Room Valve Packages</h1>
			<p class="mt-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">The fire pump room is more than the pump: it is the suction, discharge, check, isolation and test arrangement that lets the pump supplier’s fire pump set operate safely and lets the fire department add water through a compatible Siamese connection. Wanlian supplies the surrounding valves and connections; the fire pump set is by others.</p>

			<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
				{['Siamese Adapter', 'Suction Isolation', 'Discharge Check', 'Pump Set by Others'].map(b => (
					<div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="text-xs font-black text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-wider">{b}</span></div>
				))}
			</div>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">Fire Pump Connection Components</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
				{products.map(p => (
					<a href={`/products/${p.slug}/`} class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-red hover:shadow-md transition">
						<img src={p.img} alt={p.name} loading="lazy" class="w-full h-28 object-contain bg-white p-2" />
						<div class="p-3"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-brand-red leading-snug transition-colors">{p.name}</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1 line-clamp-2">{p.desc}</p></div>
					</a>
				))}
			</div>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">Pump Room Selection Table</h2>
			<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200 my-5">
				<table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-sm">
					<thead class="bg-gray-50"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Arrangement</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Verified selection reference</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
						<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Fire department connection</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">SQD100-1.6: two DN65 inlets with SQS65 / KWS65 caps, DN100 flanged outlet, 1.6 MPa, integrated control valve.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Isolation valves</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">UL/FM OS&Y gate valve: 2"–10", grooved ends, rising stem; Z41X flanged gate valve: DN50–DN700, PN10 / PN16.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Discharge check</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">HQ44X spherical ball check valve: DN50–DN400, 1.6 MPa (PN16), non-blocking flow channel and EPDM / NBR sealing.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Pressure management</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">500X hydraulic pressure-reducing valve: DN20–DN600; adjustment range 0.1–1.6 MPa; confirm its role in the approved downstream design.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-gray-900">Pump and test data</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-700">Provide pump supplier flow/head data, pipe sizes, test arrangement and applicable approval requirements before final valve sizing.</td></tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">What to Include in One Pump-Room Order</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
				<li><strong>Connection point</strong> — Siamese inlet standard, outlet flange, cap arrangement and fire department interface.</li>
				<li><strong>Suction and discharge set</strong> — isolation valve, check valve and any pressure-control item matched to the approved piping schedule.</li>
				<li><strong>Test and commissioning details</strong> — test header or test outlet arrangement, instruments by others where applicable, and the pump supplier’s certified curve.</li>
				<li><strong>Submittal package</strong> — drawings, product data, certificates, connection dimensions, pressure class and destination-market marking.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4 tracking-tight">Pump Room Design Resources</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Use the <a href="/guides/fire-pump-room-valves-guide/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">fire pump room valves guide</a> for suction, discharge and test planning, the <a href="/guides/fire-department-connection-siamese-guide/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">Siamese fire department connection guide</a>, and the <a href="/guides/check-valve-types-guide/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:underline">check valve types guide</a> when preparing the valve schedule.</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			<div class="space-y-4">{faq.map(item => (<details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 p-5 open:border-brand-red/30"><summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer list-none"><span>{item.question}</span><span class="text-brand-blue text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">{item.answer}</p></details>))}</div>

			<div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden"><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue to-blue-800 px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 text-center"><h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Need a Fire Pump Connection Package?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-blue-100 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Send the pump supplier’s flow/head data and your valve schedule — we will coordinate the verified adapter and valve package within 12 hours.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4"><a href="/contact/?product=Fire%20Pump%20Connections" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-red text-white font-bold rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition">Request a Quote</a><a href="https://wa.me/8618684324501?text=Hi%2C%20I%20need%20fire%20pump%20connections" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-brand-blue font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a></div></div></div>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>
